  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against Plump Lady, Fang Yuan takes burial dragon sand coffin without injury while this defensive killer move runs on his immortal zombie body. Immortal zombie hair is already tough as steel, so the same cast outperforms ordinary Gu Immortal bodies. In the five regions chaotic war it is the most common defensive killer move of its kind.",
      "chapters": [
        675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_plump_lady",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal Gu Dark Arrow can pierce it in one hit, and his immortal zombie body alone cannot stop that Gu either.",
      "chapters": [
        677
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_dark_arrow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Full-body coverage leaves no gaps, so it cannot run together with the movement killer move Kong Sheng Tian, which needs open pores; the two are incompatible.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_kong_sheng_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With icy drill stardust, light illusion bat wings, and hair armor in normal form, his battle strength sits at the upper tier of rank six; the immortal killer move myriad self is what pushes him to peak rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        681
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During Hei Lou Lan’s flying blade noise tribulation the armor lasts about three breaths before breaking, and he has to cast again for a thin new layer.",
      "chapters": [
        684
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a sea of snakes it keeps small snakes from boring into his stomach until he withdraws it to absorb them.",
      "chapters": [
        688
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Against mortal Gu Masters at an oasis, dozens of rank five Gu among several hundred keep regenerating the black spiked armor in a few breaths on his immortal zombie foundation.",
      "chapters": [
        694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Market pricing later puts the prior version around two to two and a half immortal essence stones, at the peak of common mortal killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The core remains Indestructible Steel Mane Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limits",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_indestructible_steel_mane_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After days of testing he merges large numbers of rank five Golden Lion Fur Gu into the foundation, drops the spikes, turns the black iron look to bronze, doubles thickness, shapes the helmet as a roaring lion, and raises defense by about one hundred and fifty percent, or two hundred percent against metal path attacks. He names that version lion fur armor. Against a test press of icy drill stardust, the new armor only cracks where the old one shattered, and market value for lion fur armor rises to about four and a half immortal essence stones.",
      "chapters": [
        712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "armor-upgrade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_golden_lion_fur_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Much later both hair armor and lion fur armor remain listed among defenses he once used, but as mortal killer moves he has already eliminated them.",
      "chapters": [
        1700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "armor-upgrade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
